      "product_summary": "Suede Mary Jane shoes with two buckle straps and contrasting white upper panels. The open vamp and double-strap arrangement create a recognizable flat casual silhouette. Genuine-leather lining and rubber sole layers form the documented construction in Coffee and Green.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. works with international B2B footwear buyers on product enquiries. Specifications, order options and quotations are confirmed for each selected style and order."
